{"id": "msg_2124a2bef213488ebcde12fe28f30ad6", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "证据覆盖 40/45 条，均有精确代码文件在业务仓命中。剩余 5 条 NOFILE 中 3 条是偏好/经验类记忆，2 条需补核（register_add_401、禅道bug6955）。做最后一轮针对性核对。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b52c626a4f2aad93", "tool_name": "ops_bash", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"command": "python -c \"\nimport os\nROOT=r'D:/repository'\n# check具体的符号存在性（读具体文件）\nchecks=[\n ('苏住房防汛C端','src/pages/home/index.vue',['getKeyData','getBenefitData','parentDeptId']),\n ('产品2.0','zhi2-web-admin/src/views/register',['applyId','company/base/add']),\n]\nfor repo,sub,syms in checks:\n    base=os.path.join(ROOT,repo,sub)\n    hits={s:[] for s in syms}\n    if os.path.isdir(base):\n        for dp,dn,fns in os.walk(base):\n            dn[:]=[d for d in dn if d not in ('node_modules','dist','.git')]\n            for fn in fns:\n                if not fn.endswith(('.vue','.js','.ts')): continue\n                try: t=open(os.path.join(dp,fn),encoding='utf-8',errors='ignore').read()\n                except: continue\n                for s in syms:\n                    if s in t: hits[s].append(fn)\n    elif os.path.isfile(base):\n        t=open(base,encoding='utf-8',errors='ignore').read()\n        for s in syms:\n            if s in t: hits[s].append(os.path.basename(base))\n    print(repo,sub,'->',{s:len(v) for s,v in hits.items()})\n\"", "description": "核对register和bug6955关键符号", "workdir": "D:/repository/skills"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T10:18:20.035Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
