{"id": "msg_1220a402c257434caac7f7c6e029d2a6", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "关键结论：\n- **bug6955**：`home/index.vue` 中 `getKeyData`/`getBenefitData`/`parentDeptId` 全部命中 → VALID。\n- **register_add_401**：记忆声称项目代码里 `applyId`/`company/base/add` 应存在，但产品2.0 注册页查无。这条记忆描述的是\"修复方案/现状 companyId 已忽略 add 哨兵值\"，需看它归属哪个仓。让我确认这条记忆有无涉及项目字段，并针对性搜下 register 页。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b06d3dbbc0dd77ba", "tool_name": "ops_bash", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"command": "python -c \"\nimport os\nROOT=r'D:/repository'\n# 全业务仓搜 register 页面里 companyId/applyId 哨兵处理（限定 views/register 或 register 相关目录，读文件）\nfound=[]\nfor repo in os.listdir(ROOT):\n    p=os.path.join(ROOT,repo)\n    if repo in ('all','skills','OpenViking') or not os.path.isdir(p): continue\n    for dp,dn,fns in os.walk(p):\n        dn[:]=[d for d in dn if d not in ('node_modules','dist','.git','build')]\n        low=dp.replace(chr(92),'/').lower()\n        if 'register' not in low: continue\n        for fn in fns:\n            if not fn.endswith(('.vue','.js')): continue\n            fp=os.path.join(dp,fn)\n            try: t=open(fp,encoding='utf-8',errors='ignore').read()\n            except: continue\n            if 'applyId' in t and ('companyId' in t or 'base/add' in t or 'company/base' in t):\n                found.append(repo+':'+os.path.relpath(fp,os.path.join(ROOT,repo)).replace(chr(92),'/'))\nfor f in found[:20]: print(f)\nprint('count',len(found))\n\"", "description": "搜注册页哨兵值处理代码", "workdir": "D:/repository/skills", "timeoutMs": 120000}}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T10:18:25.350Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
